1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,100
I recently handled a case

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,120
about toxic managers and employees.

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:05,860
I will share it now.

4
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:08,520
I am Dr. Hyma Prasad, Psychologist.

5
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:12,060
A young boy I know,

6
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,880
who was very smart,

7
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,580
secured a job at an MNC

8
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:19,500
at a very young age.

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,680
While he was working there,

10
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:24,280
his colleagues at the workplace

11
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,680
were much older than him.

12
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:29,580
As he performed really well

13
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:33,280
and delivered good results,

14
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,800
his salary kept increasing.

15
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,380
Compared to his peers,

16
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,820
he earned twice as much.

17
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,140
This made them feel jealous,

18
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,480
and they constantly criticized him.

19
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:47,780
Right in front of him,

20
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:50,400
they used vulgar language

21
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:52,880
and verbally abused him.

22
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,600
This pushed him into depression.

23
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,740
Later, he came to consult me.

24
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:01,980
When we analyzed

25
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:04,900
why he fell into this state,

26
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:07,760
his surrounding environment

27
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:10,360
had a massive negative impact.

28
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:12,840
He joined to work happily,

29
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,920
was highly knowledgeable,

30
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:17,220
and mingled well with everyone.

31
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:20,260
Yet their intention to push him out

32
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:23,300
created a devastating impact

33
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:26,880
on his entire life.

